# Chemiinformatics_work

This workspace contains the main `Chemistry2quant` project alongside this top-level README.
Use the structure below to navigate the repository quickly.

## Repository layout

```
Chemiinformatics_work/
├── Chemistry2quant/
│   ├── AUTHORS.rst
│   ├── CHANGELOG.rst
│   ├── LICENSE.txt
│   ├── README.rst
│   ├── docs/
│   ├── psi4numpy/
│   ├── requirements.txt
│   ├── setup.cfg
│   ├── setup.py
│   ├── src/
│   │   └── molecule/
│   └── test/
└── README
```

## Key directories

- `Chemistry2quant/`: Primary Python package, docs, and experiments.
- `Chemistry2quant/src/molecule/`: Molecule-focused ML and graph workflows.
- `Chemistry2quant/psi4numpy/`: Psi4NumPy tutorial content.
- `Chemistry2quant/docs/`: Project documentation sources.
- `Chemistry2quant/test/`: Tests and checks.
